te:max-mobile:text-small nav-phone whitespace-nowrap max-[1021px]:hidden max-mobile:block group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:hidden" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> <a href="/quote/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-nav font-extrabold group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small max-mobile:w-full group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:px-3">Get a Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <script type="module">const t=document.querySelector(".mobile-toggle"),n=document.querySelector("#nav-links");t?.addEventListener("click",()=>{const s=n?.classList.toggle("open")??!1;t.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(s))});document.addEventListener("click",s=>{const e=s.target;if(!(e instanceof Node))return;const o=document.querySelector(".nav-services");o?.open&&!o.contains(e)&&(o.open=!1),n?.classList.contains("open")&&!n.contains(e)&&!t?.contains(e)&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"))});document.addEventListener("keydown",s=>{if(s.key!=="Escape")return;const e=document.querySelector(".nav-services");e?.open?(e.open=!1,e.querySelector("summary")?.focus()):n?.classList.contains("open")&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"),t instanceof HTMLElement&&t.focus())});</script> <main id="main-content" class="scroll-mt-20" tabindex="-1">   <section class="border-b border-line bg-mist pt-[56px] pb-[54px] max-mobile:pt-9 max-mobile:pb-10"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-sea-dark flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>About</p> <h1 class="max-w-[860px] text-page-title font-black leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em] max-w-[780px]">A local cleaning business you can reach directly.</h1> <p class="max-w-[700px] text-lede mt-[18px]">Beachline Cleaners is owner-operated and based in Brevard County, serving homes, vacation rentals, move-in/move-out properties, and workspaces across the Space Coast.</p> </div> </section> <section class="py-section max-mobile:py-12"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.92fr_1.08fr] items-center gap-16 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-8"> <div> <img class="w-full aspect-[1.25] rounded-panel object-cover shadow-[0_18px_55px_rgba(28,65,91,.08)] max-tablet:aspect-[16/9]" src="/images/after_clean.jpg" alt="A freshly cleaned home, bright and organized"> </div> <div> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-sea-dark flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>How we work</p> <h2 class="max-w-[620px]">Simple communication, start to finish.</h2> <p class="mt-6 text-nav font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-sea-dark">Based in Brevard County</p> <p class="max-w-[700px] text-lede mt-3">Beachline Cleaners is independently owned and operated in Brevard County. When you call or text, you’re talking directly with the person running the business about the property, what needs cleaning, and the schedule.</p> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px]">Tell us what needs attention and any extras you want included. We’ll agree on the checklist, price, access, and timing before the visit, so you know exactly what was booked.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px]">Have pets, delicate surfaces, or a product preference? Tell us when we set up the clean. If you’ll be out, we’ll work out secure access ahead of time.</p> <div class="mt-8 border-b border-line"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[14px_1fr] items-center gap-3 border-t border-line py-3.5 font-[700]"> <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-teal" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span>Cleaning checklist agreed before the visit</span> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[14px_1fr] items-center gap-3 border-t border-line py-3.5 font-[700]"> <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-teal" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span>Appliance interiors and other extras quoted separately</span> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[14px_1fr] items-center gap-3 border-t border-line py-3.5 font-[700]"> <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-teal" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span>Standard cleaning supplies and equipment provided</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-ocean text-white py-[66px] max-mobile:py-12"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center max-tablet:grid-cols-1 gap-10"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-cyan"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></span>Next step</p> <h2 class="max-w-[720px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em] text-white text-[clamp(2.25rem,4.2vw,3.8rem)]">Need a cleaner?</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px] text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.65] text-white/70">Tell us what you need cleaned and when you need it. We’ll work through the details with you and confirm the price before anything is booked.</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-mobile:w-full max-mobile:[&>*]:grow"> <a href="/quote/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-white text-sea-dark hover:bg-mist active:bg-seafoam min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Get a Quote<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a href="tel:+13213239776" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-[1.5px] border-white/70 bg-transparent text-white hover:border-white hover:bg-white/15 active:bg-white/25 min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Call (321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class="footer bg-footer pt-7 pb-5 text-white group-[.island-home]/site:bg-footer max-mobile:pt-6 max-mobile:pb-[calc(64px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] group-[.no-mobile-bar]/site:max-mobile:pb-[max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr_.7fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-5 max-mobile:grid-cols-2 max-mobile:gap-x-5"> <div class="max-mobile:col-span-2"> <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap font-black tracking-[-.03em] text-mist no-underline group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text" href="/"> <span class="brand-mark relative size-[38px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[50%_50%_46%_54%] bg-sea-dark group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:size-8" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="grid leading-none"> <span>Beachline Cleaners</span> <span class="mt-1.5 text-[.64rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-cyan">Home &amp; Property Cleaning</span> </span> </a> <p class="mt-3 max-w-[430px] text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-tex